WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:03.569 line:0%
-Gigi Hadid, I love you so much.
Welcome.

00:00:03.569 --> 00:00:05.304 line:0%
-Hi, Jimmy. Love you.

00:00:05.304 --> 00:00:07.240 line:0%
-Thank you so much
for doing our show,

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:12.245 line:0%
and I got to say congratulations
on expecting a baby.

00:00:12.245 --> 00:00:14.947 line:0%
It's just the best news ever.

00:00:14.947 --> 00:00:16.416 line:0%
-Thank you so much.

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:20.220
Obviously, we wish we could've
announced it on our own terms,

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:23.523
but we're very excited and happy

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:26.626
and grateful for everyone's
well wishes and support.

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:27.927
So, thanks.

00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:30.029
-It's the best news
that you could ever have

00:00:30.029 --> 00:00:32.899
in the entire world,
even in this crazy world

00:00:32.899 --> 00:00:34.733
where any news is
kind of good news.

00:00:34.733 --> 00:00:37.103 line:0%
Your news was great news.

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:41.841 line:0%
-Yeah, definitely non-bad news,
and we're super happy now.

00:00:41.841 --> 00:00:45.477 line:0%
-It was a ray of sunshine
that we all needed.

00:00:45.477 --> 00:00:46.945
And, so, I'm so happy.

00:00:46.945 --> 00:00:49.482
And I will tell you this.

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:52.184
Tons of people will give you
advice and stuff like that,

00:00:52.184 --> 00:00:54.553
and they're like,
"Oh, they grow up so fast.

00:00:54.553 --> 00:00:56.122
Enjoy it."

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:57.489
And I don't want to be
that person

00:00:57.489 --> 00:00:59.426
because they are kind of right.

00:00:59.426 --> 00:01:03.796
But don't over do it, but just
be present for every part of it.

00:01:03.796 --> 00:01:07.266
-Yeah. No, I'm trying, like,
especially during this time.

00:01:07.266 --> 00:01:12.004
It's a nice silver lining
to be able to, like, be home

00:01:12.004 --> 00:01:16.776
and together and really
experience it day by day.

00:01:16.776 --> 00:01:19.245
-Congrats to Zayn, too,
and tell him

00:01:19.245 --> 00:01:21.915
that if you guys need anything,
call Uncle Jimmy.

00:01:21.915 --> 00:01:23.749
I'll make sure you guys
are taken care of.

00:01:23.749 --> 00:01:25.885
-Oh, best Uncle Jimmy.

00:01:25.885 --> 00:01:28.154
-Happy birthday, by the way.
That was last week.

00:01:28.154 --> 00:01:31.791
-Yeah, 25. It was good.

00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:35.494
I saw some Instagram photos
of you, and it looked like fun.

00:01:35.494 --> 00:01:37.596
Was it a giant bagel involved
or something?

00:01:37.596 --> 00:01:41.634
-Yeah, so we did, like,
a breakfast party of, like,

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:44.937
a few people and then a dinner
party with the same few people.

00:01:44.937 --> 00:01:48.274
So, we tried to, like,
make it a day, but, yeah,

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:51.043
in the morning,
my family brought out

00:01:51.043 --> 00:01:54.780
a everything bagel cake,
which already blew my mind

00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:58.317
because my craving has been
everything bagels.

00:01:58.317 --> 00:02:01.620
I eat a everything bagel a day,
and, so, I was already, like,

00:02:01.620 --> 00:02:04.757
so excited that my birthday cake
was a everything bagel.

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:06.625
-Yeah, that's awesome.

00:02:06.625 --> 00:02:08.328
-But then I found out
that Buddy,

00:02:08.328 --> 00:02:10.429
the Cake Boss, made my cake.

00:02:10.429 --> 00:02:13.566 line:0%
-Wait! That was a cake?!
-Yes! Yes!

00:02:13.566 --> 00:02:16.469 line:0%
-I thought it was a giant bagel!
No, it was actually the cake.

00:02:16.469 --> 00:02:19.605 line:0%
It was marble cake
with chocolate buttercream

00:02:19.605 --> 00:02:21.574
and then chocolate-chip
buttercream inside.

00:02:21.574 --> 00:02:23.076
It was my favorite.
-"Cake Boss." He's a genius.

00:02:23.076 --> 00:02:25.978
-"Cake Boss."
Like, I can do the whole,

00:02:25.978 --> 00:02:31.817
like, [ As Buddy ]
"Welcome to Carlo's Bakery.

00:02:31.817 --> 00:02:34.287
Every month,
thousands of cakes and pastries

00:02:34.287 --> 00:02:37.723 line:0%
goes out these doors."
-[ Laughing ]

00:02:37.723 --> 00:02:41.093 line:0%
-"This is the crew,
mia famiglia.

00:02:41.093 --> 00:02:43.863 line:0%
We're gonna take this bakery
to the top.

00:02:43.863 --> 00:02:46.699
They call me Buddy.
I'm the boss."

00:02:46.699 --> 00:02:48.400
[ Normal voice ]
Like, I will binge that.

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:50.837
I love him.
And I don't know if it was,

00:02:50.837 --> 00:02:53.573
like, my hormones right now

00:02:53.573 --> 00:02:58.411
or, like, just, like,
quarantine emotional-ness.

00:02:58.411 --> 00:03:01.847
Like, I cried every five minutes
for, like, an hour.

00:03:01.847 --> 00:03:05.251
Every time I thought about
that Buddy made my cake,

00:03:05.251 --> 00:03:07.754
I couldn't stop crying.

00:03:07.754 --> 00:03:10.757
-Bagel cake made you cry.
-Of happiness.

00:03:10.757 --> 00:03:13.426
I was just so, like,
honored that he would, like,

00:03:13.426 --> 00:03:15.528
make me a cake
during quarantine.

00:03:15.528 --> 00:03:17.063
-That's super cool.

